# `resall` / `resall_fast` / `resall_slow` — tiered local test rituals

**Purpose:** Repeatable merge gates with **two correctness tiers** so everyday UI/knowledge work does not pay OpenAI + cold-stack tax.

| Chat trigger | CLI | What it proves |
|--------------|-----|----------------|
| **`resall_fast`** | `run_all.py resall-fast` | **1.1 essential + fast** — no OpenAI ritual phases |
| **`resall_slow`** | `run_all.py resall-slow` | **1.2 live LLM / specialty** |
| **`resall`** | `run_all.py resall` | **1.1 then 1.2** (continue-on-error; one recap) |

**Why tiers:** Fast = wired app/DB/browser correctness without billing. Slow = model-quality and specialty probes. Prefer **`resall_fast`** after UI/knowledge edits; use slow/full when PLGW prompts or live harness change.

**Does not touch** habitual **`:8000`** / **`:5173`**. SQLite E2E uses **`:8002`** / **`:4173`**.

**Catalog:** `ops/local/local_tests/resall_phase_catalog.py` · `uv run python ops/local/run_all.py resall --list-phases`

---

## When this applies

- **Triggers:** whole-word **`resall`**, **`resall_fast`**, or **`resall_slow`** (or `@` this rule).
- **Intent:** Run the matching CLI **in the real environment**; wait for exit; report `[resall] summary`.

---

## Category 1.1 — `resall-fast` (phases 1–7)

**Why these stay in 1.1:** Stub/SQLite E2E proves product paths without OpenAI; conjugation journey is essential UX; grid-filter is folded into integration to drop stack tax.

| # | Phase | Notes |
|---|-------|-------|
| 1 | unittest discover | Share fixtures — wall is bootstrap, not assert count |
| 2 | pytest openapi | Contract |
| 3 | Vitest | Knowledge/table growth lands here |
| 4 | Playwright mocked | Cheap browser; locator discipline |
| 5 | e2e-test full-stack | Warm stack start |
| 6 | e2e-test integration | Stub verify-exhaust + **folded grid-filter** |
| 7 | e2e-test 8-p-full | Conjugation only (`E2E_8P_PLGW=0`) |

```bash
uv run python ops/local/run_all.py resall-fast
```

**Warm stack:** Ritual sets `E2E_KEEP_STACK` / `E2E_STACK_ADOPT` across phases 5–7 (API recycle for stub↔normal; Vite kept). Solo `e2e-test *` still start+stop.

---

## Category 1.2 — `resall-slow` (phases 8–10)

**Why only here:** Live generate is orthogonal, slow, and flaky relative to stubs — do not block every UI edit.

| # | Phase | Notes |
|---|-------|-------|
| 8 | e2e-test real-llm `--np 4` | **Sole** ritual volume batch |
| 9 | e2e-test real-llm-conseguir-sf | Specialty |
| 10 | e2e-test real-llm-verb-family | Specialty |

```bash
uv run python ops/local/run_all.py resall-slow
```

**Not in ritual (ad hoc):** `--np 1`, `--np 8`, `real-llm-smoke` (`PW_PLGW_LIVE_SMOKE=1`), solo `e2e-test grid-filter`, solo `8-p-full` with live PLGW. See **eellm** rule / `e2e-test real-llm --np N`.

**Why `--np 4` alone:** Mid-size multi-verb/tense sample; avoids paying for np1+np8+smoke duplicates. **Why no 8-p live PLGW when np 4 runs:** same generate path; double OpenAI is pure cost.

